1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
一条鱼，划一百多刀
One fish. A hundred knife cuts.

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
横八刀，竖八刀，128个棱
Eight by eight — 128 diamonds

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
刀刀断肉，不断骨
Through the flesh, never the bone

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
拍层淀粉，下滚油
Dust it in starch, into hot oil

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,000
鱼肉一炸就开花
In the oil, the flesh blooms open

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,200
头昂尾翘，像只松鼠
Head up, tail curled — a squirrel

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
苏州松鹤楼，始于1757
Suzhou's Songhelou, since 1757

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,600
相传乾隆想尝这条"神鱼"
Legend: Qianlong eyed a "sacred fish"

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,800
厨师改成松鼠形，避杀神之罪
So the chef disguised it as a squirrel

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,000
糖醋滚汁一浇，滋滋响
Hot sweet-sour sauce hits — it sizzles

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,400
那声儿，真像松鼠叫
That sound? Almost a squirrel's squeak

12
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:27,000
先赏形还是先动筷？下集·剁椒鱼头
Admire it or dig in? Next: chili fish head
